<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at June 12.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at June 12.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>Sangthai Heaven   05/06/97		5,000	  Hong Kong</p>
<p>HEJIANG	     06/06/97		4,750	  Philippines</p>
<p>JINCHLIAN BAO     06/06/97		1,500	  Vietnam</p>
<p>VERTEX		06/06/97		7,200	  Vietnam</p>
<p>DAI JIANG	   09/06/97		4,820	  Singapore</p>
<p>JI DI		 09/06/97		8,100	  Philippines</p>
<p>MALATIMAS	   09/06/97		5,700	  Malaysia</p>
<p>BUDI SERYANA	10/06/97		3,800	  Malaysia</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
